></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5751208023064749707</id><published>2008-08-15T05:38:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-08-15T05:38:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Is there a way you can flag the posts of &quot;Mark the...</title><content type='html'>Is there a way you can flag the posts of &quot;Mark the Muslim/Peas Boy/Anon/happy face/whatever&quot; so time doesn&#39;t have to be wasted reading his stuff? I hate to sound testy but life is short. Just some little symbol so we know he&#39;s back.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483863439445514168/comments/default/5751208023064749707'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1483863439445514168/comments/default/5751208023064749707'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/support-your-local-rape-gang.html?showComment=1218800280000#c5751208023064749707' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/08/support-your-local-rape-gang.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1483863439445514168' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1483863439445514168' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 15, 2008 at 5:38 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1542648378119437196</id><published>2008-08-14T17:00:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-08-14T17:00:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>oops</title><content type='html'>oops</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href=